---
InheritParentConfig: true

# Test TUs are the slowest in the tree, and clang-analyzer's symbolic execution
# more than doubles them — it sets the floor on what a PR touching a test
# header costs in CI. Tests don't ship, so the analyzer earns least here. It
# still runs over src/, where a finding reaches production.
Checks: >
  -clang-analyzer-*

# Test fixtures declare global const TrackNamespace/FullTrackName/TrackAlias
# built from string literals at namespace scope. Their constructors are
# non-trivial enough to trip cert-err58-cpp, but a throwing one here fails
# every run of the binary immediately rather than lurking as a latent bug —
# see https://github.com/openmoq/moqx/issues/518.
WarningsAsErrors: >
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  concurrency-*,
  cert-*,
  -cert-err58-cpp
...
